---
title: "Chris McCann — Field Notes"
description: "Consciousness research. Leadership. The gap between what leaders do and what they're carrying when they do it. Newsletter, assessment, book."
canonicalUrl: "https://chrismccann.co"
permalink: /index.html
---
{%- extends "base.njk" -%}

{% block pagestyle %}
<style>
  .hero { padding: 112px var(--px) 96px; text-align: center; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .26em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rust); margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 72px; line-height: 1.07; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin-bottom: 30px; text-wrap: balance; max-width: 920px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--rust); }
  .hero .sub { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 44px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .form { display: flex; gap: 10px; max-width: 460px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .form input { flex: 1; padding: 15px 18px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line2); border-radius: 6px; color: var(--ink); outline: none; min-width: 0; transition: border-color .15s; -webkit-appearance: none; }
  .form input::placeholder { color: var(--dim); }
  .form input:focus { border-color: var(--muted); }
  .form button { padding: 15px 26px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .14em; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; transition: background .15s; white-space: nowrap; }
  .form button:hover { background: var(--rust); }
  .form-success { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--rust); margin-top: 12px; display: none; }
  .form-error { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #b94040; margin-top: 12px; display: none; }
  .microcopy { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .05em; color: var(--faint); margin-top: 16px; }

  .proof { padding: 0 var(--px) 80px; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .proof-inner { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 30px 0; text-align: center; }
  .proof-label { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--faint); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .logos { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px; }
  .logos img { height: 22px; width: auto; filter: grayscale(1) opacity(0.35); transition: opacity .2s; }
  .logos img:hover { filter: grayscale(1) opacity(0.55); }

  .premise { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; padding: 40px var(--px) 96px; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .premise-photo { aspect-ratio: 4/5; border: 1px solid var(--line2); overflow: hidden; }
  .premise-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 25%; filter: grayscale(100%); }
  .premise .label { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rust); margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .premise p { font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.5; }
  .premise p.big { font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.45; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .premise p.small { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); }

  .recent { padding: 0 var(--px) 96px; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .recent-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 14px; }
  .recent-head h2 { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500; }
  .recent-head a { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--muted); transition: color .15s; }
  .recent-head a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .note { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); transition: padding-left .18s; }
  .note:hover { padding-left: 10px; }
  .note-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400; }
  .note-min { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); white-space: nowrap; }

  .testi { background: var(--surface); padding: 96px var(--px); }
  .testi-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .testi-lead { max-width: 840px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .testi-lead p { font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.32; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 24px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .testi-lead .by { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--faint); }
  .testi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; max-width: 880px; margin: 64px auto 0; }
  .testi-cell { text-align: center; }
  .testi-cell p { font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .testi-cell .by { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--faint); }

  .cta { padding: 104px var(--px); text-align: center; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta h2 { font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 400; margin: 24px auto; max-width: 800px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .cta .sub { font-size: 19px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 40px; }
  .cta-btn { display: inline-block; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .14em; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); padding: 17px 36px; border-radius: 6px; transition: background .15s; }
  .cta-btn:hover { background: var(--rust); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero { padding: 72px var(--px) 64px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 40px; }
    .hero .sub { font-size: 18px; }
    .form { flex-direction: column; }
    .form button { width: 100%; padding: 15px; }
    .proof { padding: 0 var(--px) 56px; }
    .premise { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; padding: 40px var(--px) 64px; }
    .premise-photo { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
    .premise p.big { font-size: 20px; }
    .premise p.small { font-size: 16px; }
    .recent { padding: 0 var(--px) 64px; }
    .note-title { font-size: 20px; }
    .testi { padding: 64px var(--px); }
    .testi-lead p { font-size: 26px; }
    .testi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .testi-cell p { font-size: 17px; }
    .cta { padding: 72px var(--px); }
    .cta h2 { font-size: 34px; }
  }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section class="hero" id="subscribe">
  <div class="eyebrow">A newsletter on consciousness &amp; leadership</div>
  <h1>The gap between what leaders do &mdash; and what they&rsquo;re <em>carrying</em> when they do it.</h1>
  <p class="sub">Thirty years leading teams. Still figuring it out. Consciousness, leadership, and the space between them &mdash; twice a month.</p>
  <form class="form" id="subscribeForm" novalidate>
    <input type="email" id="emailInput" placeholder="you@work.com" aria-label="Email address" required autocomplete="email">
    <button type="submit" id="subBtn">I&rsquo;M IN</button>
  </form>
  <div class="form-success" id="subSuccess">You&rsquo;re in. Check your inbox.</div>
  <div class="form-error" id="subError">Something went wrong &mdash; try again.</div>
  <div class="microcopy">Two emails a month &middot; Unsubscribe anytime</div>
</section>

<section class="proof">
  <div class="proof-inner">
    <div class="proof-label">Read by 4,200+ founders, operators &amp; sales leaders</div>
    <div class="logos">
      <img src="/assets/logos/salesforce.svg" alt="Salesforce">
      <img src="/assets/logos/google.svg" alt="Google">
      <img src="/assets/logos/twilio.svg" alt="Twilio">
      <img src="/assets/logos/hubspot.svg" alt="HubSpot">
      <img src="/assets/logos/braze.png" alt="Braze">
      <img src="/assets/logos/contentstack.svg" alt="Contentstack">
      <img src="/assets/logos/commercetools.svg" alt="commercetools">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="premise">
  <div class="premise-photo">
    <img src="/images/chris-mccann.jpg" alt="Chris McCann" width="640" height="800">
  </div>
  <div>
    <div class="label">Same job underneath</div>
    <p class="big">In my early twenties I managed Hooters restaurants. Eventually I was leading go-to-market for SaaS companies. Same job underneath: read the room, set the tone, try not to be the reason people dread Mondays.</p>
    <p class="small">One Tuesday a rep closed the biggest deal in company history and the room felt dead. Numbers were right. Everything else was off. I realized the thing that was off was me.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="recent">
  <div class="recent-head">
    <h2>Recent Field Notes</h2>
    <a href="/field-notes/">All notes &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  {% for post in collections.essays %}
    {% if loop.index <= 4 %}
    <a class="note" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <span class="note-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="note-min">{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section class="testi">
  <div class="testi-inner">
    <div class="testi-lead">
      <p>&ldquo;I&rsquo;ve never seen such high EQ. He connects at a human level &mdash; reads a room, reads individuals. A student of the human psyche.&rdquo;</p>
      <div class="by">CRO</div>
    </div>
    <div class="testi-grid">
      <div class="testi-cell">
        <p>&ldquo;He cares about you as a human first &mdash; before a number, before your job. That makes him different from every other leader I&rsquo;ve had.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="by">Direct report, front-line manager</div>
      </div>
      <div class="testi-cell">
        <p>&ldquo;You felt the anxiety in my chest and moved it. I feel grounded &mdash; like I know exactly what to do.&rdquo;</p>
        <div class="by">Retreat attendee</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="eyebrow">The Field Assessment</div>
  <h2>Eighteen questions. Five minutes. What you&rsquo;re carrying into the room.</h2>
  <p class="sub">And what the room is doing with it.</p>
  <a class="cta-btn" href="/field-assessment/">TAKE THE ASSESSMENT &rarr;</a>
</section>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
<script>
document.getElementById('subscribeForm').addEventListener('submit', async function(e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  const email = document.getElementById('emailInput').value.trim();
  const btn = document.getElementById('subBtn');
  if (!email) return;
  btn.textContent = '...';
  btn.disabled = true;
  try {
    const res = await fetch('/.netlify/functions/subscribe', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({ email })
    });
    if (res.ok) {
      document.getElementById('subscribeForm').style.display = 'none';
      document.getElementById('subSuccess').style.display = 'block';
    } else {
      document.getElementById('subError').style.display = 'block';
      btn.textContent = 'I’M IN';
      btn.disabled = false;
    }
  } catch (err) {
    document.getElementById('subError').style.display = 'block';
    btn.textContent = 'I’M IN';
    btn.disabled = false;
  }
});
</script>
{% endblock %}
